    "body": "I think this makes the spec just harder to understand. Why can't there be simply a flag telling whether or not we have sticky activation? Why do we need both timestamp comparison and a flag.\r\n\r\nThe flag could be set here https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#user-activation-processing-model:~:text=Set%20window%27s%20last%20activation%20timestamp%20to%20the%20current%20high%20resolution%20time%2E  and then when the pr sets the sticky activation override flag. ",
