    "body": "You're right, that's a great catch! I think we should carry it over to same-origin bfcached documents too, to minimize differences between cases where the bfcache is hit vs. missed.\r\n\r\nI'll add a line to the \"reactivate\" algorithm similar to the one I added to the \"create and initialize a new Document\" algorithm.",
